            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) Movement and Transfers – This Article relates to movement and transfer of employees other than under the provisions of Article X. For the Customer Service Department, see exceptions as outlined in the Customer Service Department section of the Collective Bargaining Agreement.",
