        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(3) Seniority Rights When Transfers Are Made – When transfers are made between departments covered by this Agreement, the transferred employees shall continue to accumulate seniority in their former department for a period of six (6) months. At the end of six (6) months, the seniority of the transferred employees in their new department shall be started as of the date of transfer and their accumulation of seniority in their old department shall terminate, with the employee's accrued seniority in their old department remaining unchanged and to their credit.",
